  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can share the power of your hexes among numerous targets while losing none of their potency.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Split Hex<sup>UM</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> The second target of your Split Hex may be up to 30 feet plus 10 feet per mythic tier from the first target. In addition, you choose which target must save against the hex first; if that target’s save is successful, the second target takes a -2 penalty on its save.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-n-s-feats#toc80\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
